Subject: [PATCH] feat(uniswap-v2): ERC20 transfer source stage on fresh MIR

Check solar's freshly exported stage0 of UniswapV2ERC20 against the
checked source for transfer (with _transfer and SafeMath inlined) with
the generic source checker, give the stage under every oracle with
SolidCore's caller and Keccak-256, and refuse eight MIR mutants by the
kernel's evaluation of the same check.
